{
  "bookId": "hero-215003",
  "id": "bond-28528",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28528001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "各位，「生活之歌」演奏会开始了——\n今天也会用音乐，一起为大家加油的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "这一首，是新鲜的「黄瓜圆舞曲」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "叮咚叮，咚哒哒，……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "接下来，是火热的「青椒进行曲」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "然后是，酸甜的「橘子间奏曲」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28528007",
              "text": "等一下。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28528006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "怎、怎么了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……为什么都是这样的名字？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "黄瓜，青椒……橘子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "都、都是主人昨天买来的食材，我用了上面的条形码数字组，编码成了新的曲调。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "因为实在不知道该怎样起名，所以就……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28528013",
              "text": "用条形码的数组编曲吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28528013",
              "text": "真恋实在是太厉害了！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28528012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "嗯……那么请休息一下，听首新歌吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "这一首是用主人的身份ID特别编制的，「|101|之歌」——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我的身份ID？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "真恋怎么会知道这个呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28528017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "上次主人拿出证件的时候无意中看了一眼，因为觉得可能是非常好听的旋律，就不小心记住了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
